# Python bytecode from running the pipeline scripts and tests
__pycache__/

# Regenerated on every daily sync (sync_job_emails.py, pipeline_views.py,
# jobboard.mjs); the tracker notes and .sync/events.jsonl they are built from
# stay tracked.
03-Pipeline/_Inbox-Review.md
03-Pipeline/_Pipeline-Stats.md
03-Pipeline/Pipeline-Board.md
03-Pipeline/_Job-Board.md

# Run log of the launchd job
03-Pipeline/sync.log

# Mail sync state that is only meaningful on this machine: per-mailbox coverage
# checkpoints (IMAP UIDs, Mail.app positions), recently read message ids, and
# the last run's health. Losing them costs a re-read, never a missed email.
03-Pipeline/.sync/checkpoints.json
03-Pipeline/.sync/seen.json
03-Pipeline/.sync/health.json
# A state file found unreadable is moved aside here and reported by the sync.
03-Pipeline/.sync/*.corrupt
